Mirrors 电梓播放器's buildExternalLink: the player-area extends content (next to
点赞/收藏) now starts with the B站 icon, and clicking it opens that song's video
page in a new tab — the page number comes from the shared songExport2URL, so
multi-P videos land on the right part. Only rendered for B站 sources; the
playlist's right-click menu keeps offering the same action for every source.
---
